@startuml
  skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
  skinparam defaultFontSize 11

  title **Harness 核心组件交互流程（基于 demo_calculator.py）**

  actor "main()" as Main
  participant "Harness" as H
  participant "Executor\n(计算器函数)" as EX
  participant "Checkpoint" as CK
  participant "Gate" as GA
  participant "Sensor" as SE
  database "Memory" as ME

  == 1. 组装 ==
  Main -> H: Harness(gate, sensor, checkpoint)
  Main -> EX: FunctionExecutor(calculator_executor)

  == 2. Spec 验证 ==
  Main -> H: run(spec, executor)
  H -> H: spec.validate()
  H -> SE: record("execution_start")
  SE -> ME: 存储事件

  == 3. 遍历每个 Milestone（demo 仅 1 个："calculate"）==

  H -> SE: record("milestone_start")
  SE -> ME: 存储事件

  == 3a. 执行 ==
  H -> EX: execute(task, context)
  EX -> EX: eval("(100+200)*3") = 900
  EX --> H: "900"
  H -> SE: record("task_execution")
  SE -> ME: 存储

  == 3b. 验收 ==
  H -> CK: evaluate("900", exact_match("900"))
  CK -> CK: "900"=="900" → True
  CK --> H: CheckpointResult(passed=True)
  H -> SE: record("checkpoint_result")
  SE -> ME: 存储

  == 3c. 决策 ==
  H -> GA: can_proceed(milestone, result, sensor)
  GA -> SE: retry_count("calculate")
  SE -> ME: query
  ME --> SE: 0
  GA -> GA: passed=True → "proceed"
  GA --> H: GateDecision(action="proceed")
  H -> SE: record("gate_decision", "milestone_end")
  SE -> ME: 存储

  == 4. 最终验收 ==
  H -> CK: evaluate("900", final_acceptance)
  CK --> H: passed=True
  H -> SE: record("execution_end")
  SE -> ME: 存储

  == 5. 返回 ==
  H --> Main: HarnessResult(success=True, output="900")

  == 6. 失败重试路径（demo 未触发）==
  note over H, GA
    若 Checkpoint.passed=False 且 retries < max_retries
    → Gate 返回 "retry" → 回到 3a 重新执行
    若超过 max_retries → Gate 返回 "abort" → 终止任务
  end note

  @enduml